WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Xiao Qing, Xiao Lan, continue to follow me tomorrow

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,800
Xiao Sun and Lao Zhao stayed behind with Lidong

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,380
The medicine is still not enough

4
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,050
I'll have to find some more when I go back.

5
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:12,010
Got it

6
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:24,020
Ah, it smells so good. I want to use this too.

7
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:28,490
This is too fragrant

8
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:31,510
I also opened a new can of shower gel

9
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:34,110
New brand, cheap and large quantity

10
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:36,310
You can use it, you're welcome

11
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:43,190
Can we use it too?

12
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:48,940
I feel like this smell might be able to remove the human smell.

13
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:54,090
Use it if you like

14
00:00:54,090 --> 00:00:56,490
Everyone I'm talking about includes you.

15
00:00:56,490 --> 00:01:06,700
It depends on what I do. Do I want to use it too?
